WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:02.900
Are you a SMART fella,

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.933
or a FART smella?

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:06.433
Let's find OUT!

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.267
Alright,

00:00:08.267 --> 00:00:10.333
a number series!

00:00:10.333 --> 00:00:11.033
Forty-five,

00:00:11.033 --> 00:00:11.700
forty,

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:12.400
thirty-five,

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:13.067
thirty,

00:00:13.067 --> 00:00:14.433
and then...

00:00:14.433 --> 00:00:16.467
what comes next?

00:00:16.467 --> 00:00:17.167
A.

00:00:17.167 --> 00:00:17.867
Twenty-six,

00:00:17.867 --> 00:00:18.533
B.

00:00:18.533 --> 00:00:19.233
Twenty,

00:00:19.233 --> 00:00:19.900
C.

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:20.567
Twenty-five,

00:00:20.567 --> 00:00:21.933
or D.

00:00:21.933 --> 00:00:22.633
Twenty-eight?

00:00:22.633 --> 00:00:24.000
Five seconds!

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:31.000
TIME'S UP!

00:00:31.667 --> 00:00:32.367
It's...

00:00:32.367 --> 00:00:33.033
C,

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:33.733
twenty-five!

00:00:33.733 --> 00:00:37.833
Each number goes down by five:

00:00:37.833 --> 00:00:38.533
forty-five,

00:00:38.533 --> 00:00:39.200
forty,

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:39.900
thirty-five,

00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:40.600
thirty,

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:44.700
so thirty minus five is twenty-five.

00:00:45.867 --> 00:00:46.500
Alright!

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:49.733
Which one does NOT belong?

00:00:49.733 --> 00:00:50.367
A.

00:00:50.367 --> 00:00:51.033
Copper,

00:00:51.033 --> 00:00:51.667
B.

00:00:51.667 --> 00:00:52.300
Gold,

00:00:52.300 --> 00:00:52.967
C.

00:00:52.967 --> 00:00:53.600
Wood,

00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:54.900
or D.

00:00:54.900 --> 00:00:55.533
Silver?

00:00:55.533 --> 00:00:56.833
Five seconds!

00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:03.800
TIME'S UP!

00:01:04.467 --> 00:01:04.933
It's...

00:01:04.933 --> 00:01:05.433
C,

00:01:05.433 --> 00:01:05.900
wood!

00:01:05.900 --> 00:01:06.400
Copper,

00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:06.867
gold,

00:01:06.867 --> 00:01:09.267
and silver are all metals.

00:01:09.267 --> 00:01:11.200
Wood comes from trees,

00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:13.600
so it does not belong.

00:01:14.733 --> 00:01:15.767
Here's one,

00:01:15.767 --> 00:01:17.333
a number puzzle,

00:01:17.333 --> 00:01:18.933
and it's sneaky!

00:01:18.933 --> 00:01:22.067
If one plus two makes nine,

00:01:22.067 --> 00:01:24.667
two plus three makes fifteen,

00:01:24.667 --> 00:01:27.300
four plus one makes fifteen,

00:01:27.300 --> 00:01:29.900
then three plus three makes...

00:01:29.900 --> 00:01:30.433
what?

00:01:30.433 --> 00:01:30.933
A.

00:01:30.933 --> 00:01:31.467
Nine,

00:01:31.467 --> 00:01:32.000
B.

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:32.500
Twelve,

00:01:32.500 --> 00:01:33.033
C.

00:01:33.033 --> 00:01:33.567
Eighteen,

00:01:33.567 --> 00:01:34.600
or D.

00:01:34.600 --> 00:01:35.133
Six?

00:01:35.133 --> 00:01:36.167
Five seconds!

00:01:41.967 --> 00:01:43.167
TIME'S UP!

00:01:43.833 --> 00:01:45.233
The answer is...

00:01:45.233 --> 00:01:45.700
C,

00:01:45.700 --> 00:01:46.167
eighteen!

00:01:46.167 --> 00:01:48.033
Add the two numbers,

00:01:48.033 --> 00:01:49.900
then multiply by three:

00:01:49.900 --> 00:01:52.233
three plus three is six,

00:01:52.233 --> 00:01:55.033
and six times three is eighteen.

00:01:56.200 --> 00:01:56.600
So,

00:01:56.600 --> 00:01:58.633
are you smart or fart?

00:01:58.633 --> 00:02:01.067
Count up your correct answers to

00:02:01.067 --> 00:02:02.267
find your rank!

00:02:03.433 --> 00:02:03.767
So,

00:02:03.767 --> 00:02:05.167
how did you do?

00:02:05.167 --> 00:02:06.533
Comment your score below,

00:02:06.533 --> 00:02:07.900
and follow for more!
